 "_sDescription": "Customizable QOL / UI / HUD Mod For Deadlock",
 "_sText": "<b>Instructions:<br></b><ul><li>Uninstall all other HUD and UI mods</li><li>Always have QOL as #1 in mod order</li><li>Issues are mostly caused by incorrect installation</li><li>Use settings menu to import/export configurations</li><li>If you need help or need to report something use the\u00a0<a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/npCvuMcTY7\" target=\"_blank\">Discord</a><br></li><li>If saving doesn't work try QOL only first, another outdated mod may be influencing it</li></ul><br><b>Optional Addons (QOL Not Required):<br></b><ul><li>Neutral Icons - Distinct Map Icons for Improved Visibility</li><li>Sinner's Icon - Golden Sinner's Icon for Improved Visibility</li><li>Footstep Occlusion - Audio Clarity and Reduced Muddiness</li></ul><br><b>Optional Announcers:</b><br><ul><li>You can download QOL Lock announcers from other creators</li><li>Whichever slot you download for will replace that slot in the mod</li><li>There are optional default announcers you can select on install</li></ul><br><b>Other Great Mods (<span class=\"GreenColor\">Compatible</span>):</b><ul class=\"SelectedElement\"><li><a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/mods/637275\">Numeric Health</a> for enemy healthbars</li><li><a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/mods/664724\">More Alternate Icons</a> for more minimap icon choices</li><li><a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/mods/674856\">Match History Cards Redesign</a> for cleaner match history</li><li><a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/mods/656341\">OptimizationLock</a> config for better performance</li></ul><br><b>Other Great Mods (<span class=\"RedColor\">Incompatible</span>):</b><ul><li>Standalone <a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/mods/623518\">Top Bar Plus </a>for improved Top Bar</li><li>Standalone <a href=\"https://gamebanana.com/mods/664456\">Better Map</a> for improved Minimap</li></ul><br>This mod is not a mod pack but an entire overhaul to Deadlock, it includes all notable HUD and UI mods from the credits lists and builds on them extensively as well as a significant amount of custom features that are built into QOL Lock, containing over 100+ features and 300+ settings you can use to modify your game to your personal preference.<br><br>",
